CATEGORIES:Social
CATEGORIES:Dance
CATEGORIES:Fundraiser/Philanthropy
CATEGORIES:Social Event
CATEGORIES:Campus-Wide Event
DESCRIPTION:At IU Dance Marathon\, everything we do is truly to help the c
 hildren at Riley Hospital for Children. As the second-largest student-run
  philanthropy in the world\, we have raised more than $50 million for Ril
 ey Hospital for Children in Indianapolis\, IN. Since our organization’s h
 umble beginning in 1991\, we have honored Ryan White’s incredible legacy 
 by funding the Ryan White Center for Infectious Disease at Riley Hospital
 . We are now excited to have the opportunity to begin funding other areas
  of the hospital in need of our support.\nMore than 1\,000 committee memb
 ers work year-round to raise money\, plan events\, and spread awareness o
 f the miracles happening at Riley every single day. Our Dance Marathon ta
 kes place in the fall\, bringing together more than 4\,000 IU students wi
 lling to stay awake and stand on their feet for 36 hours\, honoring the b
 rave Riley kids who inspire us to make a difference in the world. We welc
 ome you to join in our efforts by making a donation or registering to par
 ticipate!\n\nHosted by: Indiana University Dance Marathon\n\nAdditional I
 nformation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/12960632
DTEND:20261108T130000Z
DTSTAMP:20261107T055320Z
