X-SOURCE-URLS:{"IU Arts & Humanities Institute": "https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2358920-potpourri-of-the-arts", "IU Auditorium": "https://events.iu.edu/iu-auditorium/event/2397007-potpourri-of-the-arts-an-african-american", "BloomingtonArts.Today": "https://www.iuauditorium.com/events/detail/potpourri-2026"}
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 130": "https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2358920-potpourri-of-the-arts"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_130
SUMMARY:Potpourri of the Arts
DTSTART:20261108T003000Z
DTEND:20261108T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260914T120735Z
UID:20261108T003000Z-2416922@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20261108T003000Z
ATTACH:https://events.iu.edu/live/image/gid/239/width/168/height/168/crop/
 1/src_region/0,0,912,1169/32128_Potpourri_2026_Flyer.rev.1787321916.png
CATEGORIES:Performances, shows, and films
DESCRIPTION:Indiana University's African American Arts Institute presents 
 Potpourri of the Arts\, a music and dance showcase representing the Africa
 n American experience\, featuring its three unique ensembles.  Witness the
  legendary African American Dance Company as it shares an eclectic array o
 f performance works from the African diaspora. Celebrate the legacy of Bla
 ck choral music with the Emmy award-winning African American Choral Ensemb
 le. And groove with the one and only IU Soul Revue as it renders timeless 
 R&amp\;B\, soul\, funk\, and contemporary Black popular styles.
GEO:39.168443;-86.517858
LAST-MODIFIED:20260914T160735Z
LOCATION:AUDITORIUM
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2358920-potpourri-of-the-arts
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Indiana University's African American Ar
 ts Institute presents <i>Potpourri of the Arts</i>\, a music and dance sho
 wcase representing the African American experience\, featuring its three u
 nique ensembles.</p><p>  Witness the legendary African American Dance Comp
 any as it shares an eclectic array of performance works from the African d
 iaspora. Celebrate the legacy of Black choral music with the Emmy award-wi
 nning African American Choral Ensemble. And groove with the one and only I
 U Soul Revue as it renders timeless R&amp\;B\, soul\, funk\, and contempor
 ary Black popular styles.</p>
