 day of each month\, join Eskenazi Museum of Art's resident Arts-based Well
 ness Experiences Manager Keaton Evans-Black to look at and talk about a pi
 ece of art from the IU museum collections using the see\, think\, wonder f
 ramework.  No previous art experience necessary!
