 L.I.P. and F.Y.F.E.P. as we celebrate you and your family. Yes\, I did sa
 y family. Feel free to bring whoever you'd like to this event\, as your f
 amily is our family.\n\nHosted by: First Year & Family Experience Program
 s\, First Generation and Limited/Low-Income Programs\n\nAdditional Inform
 ation can be found at: https://beinvolved.indiana.edu/event/11751858
