 :<i> The Gift of Collecting: Tina Jernigan</i></p><p>          Jernigan wa
 s a passionate supporter of both Indiana University and the arts. She dona
 ted artworks to the IU Public Art and Cultural Heritage Collection upon he
 r passing in 2024. With funding provided by Jernigan\, Public Art professi
 onally framed\, hung\, and preserved these pieces for this exhibit in the 
 McCalla Building and for future installations on campus.&#160\;        </p
