 en the Student Composers Association in the IU Jacobs School of Music and 
 the Eskenazi School's Grunwald Gallery. The performance will feature premi
 eres by composers Sam Thompson\, Anchi Wang-Hall\, Devon Lee\, Archer Lohm
 an\, and Darren Binkowski.</p><p class="p1">  "STORY" is a creation myth d
 rawn from the lived experience of the artist\, who was born and raised in 
 Japan as a third-generation Korean national. Infused with theatrical eleme
 nts and embodied performance\, "STORY" explores how one might establish a 
 sense of self and live with rootedness amid the constant flux of identity.
 </p>
