SUMMARY:Brown County Songwriter Showdown - FINALS!
DESCRIPTION:Finalists: \nTaylor Hernly\nChris Wolf\nJon and Sarah Giddens\nJake Cruser\n\nSpecial Musical Guest:\nShelby County Sinners\n\n\nJoin us at the Brown County Playhouse as local singer-songwriters take the stage to battle it out with original music. You get to be the judge\, so vote for your favorites and help decide THE WINNER!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nSupport local live music\, discover new voices\, and be part of the excitement! \nA huge thank you to our sponsors! Featured sponsor: Hills O’Brown Vacation Rentals. Supporting sponsors: Amplify Nashville\, Overlook Services\, and Rainwater Studios. And a shoutout to our radio partners\, Hoosier Country 105.1 FM WHCC and B97 WBWB! \n* Participants are subject to change without notice. \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/brown-county-songwriter-showdown-finals/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Featured Event,Music
