 Registration: $80.00 (October 1 - November 15\, 2026)  &#160\;2026 Keynote
  Speakers:  Aluki Kotierk  Armando Muyolema  Diego A. Titueña Matango  Te
 resa L. McCarty  &#160\;  Conference on Global and Indigenous Studies (CGI
 S) is made possible by the support from:&#160\;African Studies Program (ht
