SUMMARY:Pottery Wheel Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261117T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261117T220000
DTSTAMP:20260915T160813Z
UID:MEC-9708f313b97d9d42d74d6cd771d715a4@browncounty.com__20261117
SEQUENCE:3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 09/Fall26_OLW_Pottery_Wheel_small.jpg
CATEGORIES:Art Events &amp\; Exhibits,Classes &amp\; Workshops
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260915
DESCRIPTION:Ever wanted to try your hand at pottery? Give it a spin…Come
  and try! We’ll show you the basics of how to throw on the wheel. You
 ’ll make a small bowl or cup and choose a glaze. Firing and finishing yo
 ur piece takes some time\, so your piece will be shipped to you after your
  visit. Bring a friend. Spots limited to 6 per time slot. Cost of this wor
 kshop includes instruction\, glaze\, firing and shipping. Ages 10+.\n
