SUMMARY:CLACS Faculty Research Symposium with Nilesh Shinde
DTSTART:20261117T210000Z
DTEND:20261117T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20261103T094739Z
UID:20261117T210000Z-2471900@events.iu.edu
