DESCRIPTION:Bloomington Press Club welcomes featured speaker Marjorie Hers
 hey\, Professor Emerita of Political Science at Indiana University\, for a
 n analysis of what the midterm election results will mean for Hoosiers and
  the nation.\n\nNetworking and BYOL (bring your own lunch): 11:45 a.m.\nPr
 ogram: 12:10 to 1:00 p.m.\n\nLocation: Lamkin Hall\, Room C131\, Ivy Tech 
 Community College Bloomington (enter through Doors 2 or 3)\nParking is fre
 e for guests. Guests are welcome.\n\nPili's Party Taco and Needmore Coffee
  are inside Ivy Tech if you want to stop by for a snack or lunch before th
 e meeting.\n\nCan't make it in person? Join via Zoom: https://franklincoll
 ege-edu.zoom.us/j/99946422390\n\nMore info: https://bloomingtonpressclub.o
 rg/last-meeting/\n\nListed on BloomingtonOnline.com
