BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 64": "https://events.iu.edu/lawiub/event/2473278-pilf-cornhole-tournament-fundraiser"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_64
SUMMARY:PILF Cornhole Tournament Fundraiser
DTSTART:20261119T213000Z
DTEND:20261119T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20261104T160801Z
UID:20261119T213000Z-2473278@events.iu.edu
RECURRENCE-ID:20261119T213000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Public Interest Law Foundation (PILF) is hosting a cornhol
 e tournament to raise funds for public interest internship summer salaries
 ! The tournament will be on the law school lawn from 4:30-6:30 pm on Thurs
 day\, November 19! Contestants must make a minimum $5 donation and complet
 e the registration form to participate.  Contestants will compete in group
 s of two. Each contestant must complete the registration form by 12:00pm E
 T on Wednesday\, November 18. If you have already picked a teammate\, you 
 can add their name. If you select a teammate after completing this form\, 
 please email iupilf@iu.edu (mailto:iupilf@iu.edu) with both names. If you 
 don't have a partner by the deadline\, one will be assigned to you.  On No
 vember 19\, contestants will have to show confirmation of their donation a
 nd complete a waiver when they sign in for the event.Register and donate u
 sing the links below!Registration Form:https://forms.gle/UszRUSjQbKvFcEpv7
