X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Public Interest Law Foundation (PILF
 ) is hosting a cornhole tournament to raise funds for public interest inte
 rnship summer salaries! The tournament will be on the law school lawn from
  4:30-6:30 pm on <strong>Thursday\, November 19</strong>! Contestants must
  make a minimum $5 donation and complete the registration form to particip
 ate.</p><p>  Contestants will compete in groups of two. <strong>Each conte
 stant must complete the registration form by 12:00pm ET on Wednesday\, Nov
 ember 18</strong>. If you have already picked a teammate\, you can add the
 ir name. If you select a teammate after completing this form\, please emai
 l <a href="mailto:iupilf@iu.edu">iupilf@iu.edu</a> with both names. If you
  don't have a partner by the deadline\, one will be assigned to you.</p><p
 >  On November 19\, contestants will have to show confirmation of their do
 nation and complete a waiver when they sign in for the event.</p><p><stron
 g>Register and donate using the links below!</strong></p><p><strong>Regist
 ration Form:</strong><a href="https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.c
