 /168/crop/1/src_region/0\,0\,768\,568/32669_Kristyna-and-Marek-Milde-Arbom
 obile-photo-by-Hudacinova-WEB.rev.1790107452.jpg
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:<p class="p1">\n  Kristýna and Marek Milde\, "A
 rbomobile"\, 2025\, installation view from the solo exhibition Call of the
  Forest at Kunsthalle Praha\, NYC taxi (Ford Crown Victoria)\, living tree
 s\, plants\, moss\, soil\n</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p class="p1">\n  Artistic collaborators Kristýna and
  Marek Milde explore the shifting relationship between human-made environm
 ents and the living world.\n</p>
