SUMMARY:Esperanto Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261121T180000
DTSTAMP:20261107T055339Z
UID:sa7qagnpjj300i745e9ihs591p@google.com__20261121
SEQUENCE:2
CREATED:20260329T203244Z
DESCRIPTION:Esperanto is a language created to help people communicate if 
 they don't share a native language.  It's easy to learn\, and has speakers
  scattered all over the world.  The Bloomington Esperanto Club gathers eve
 ry two weeks to practice and study together.
