CREATED:20261029
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an evening of delicious food\, beautiful artwork\, and u
 nique finds at St. David’s Episcopal Church in Bean Blossom\, Indiana!\n
 Join St. David’s for a homemade spaghetti dinner and silent auction feat
 uring an exciting collection of fine art\, antiques\, collectibles\, and j
 ewelry. Browse original oil and watercolor paintings\, signed prints\, pho
 tography\, designer floral arrangements\, handmade canes\, fine antiques\,
  and more. It’s a wonderful opportunity to discover one-of-a-kind treasu
 res and get a head start on holiday shopping!\nDinner is $15 per person an
 d includes homemade spaghetti\, salad\, a beverage\, and dessert.\nBest of
  all\, proceeds benefit nonprofit organizations locally and around the wor
 ld.\nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, November 21\, 2026\nTime: 5:00–7:
 10 PM\nLocation: St. David’s Episcopal Church\, Bean Blossom\, Indiana (
 intersection of State Roads 135 and 45)\nDinner: $15 per person\nReservati
 ons: Requested but not required\n\nEvening Schedule\n\n5:00 PM: Doors open
 \; silent auction browsing and bidding begin\n5:45 PM: Spaghetti dinner\n6
 :15 PM: Auction browsing and bidding continue\n6:30 PM: Dessert\n6:50 PM: 
 Final opportunity to browse and place bids\n7:10 PM: Bidding closes\, foll
 owed by checkout\n\nSome auction items may have reserve prices.\nFor more 
 information or reservations:\nEmail: info@stdavidsbb.org ( mailto:info@std
 avidsbb.org )\nPhone: 812-988-1038\nCome enjoy an evening of food\, fellow
 ship\, and holiday shopping while supporting meaningful causes!\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261029
LOCATION:11 IN-45\, Morgantown\, IN 46160
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
