  during an experiential learning opportunity. By completing the applicatio
 n\, you will be considered for each scholarship the Walter Center has to o
 ffer.</p><p><strong>The application for Spring 2027 Experiential Learning 
 scholarships closes on Sunday\, November 22.&#160\;</strong></p><p><a href
 ="https://careers.college.indiana.edu/work-experience/experiential-learnin
 g-scholarships/index.html">Learn More + Apply</a></p>
