SUMMARY: Trivia Night w/Bloomington Pub Quiz!
DESCRIPTION:Hey smart people!! Trivia Nights are now your favorite thing 
 to do on Mondays! We promise to keep the sports to a minimum!\n\nCome out
  on Monday nights from 8:30-10pm for your chance off that brain power to 
