DESCRIPTION:Discover art on the first and second floors of the museum\, sp
 anning from ancient civilizations to modern art and enjoy activities along
  the way. Collaborate to interpret works of art through music\, sketching\
 , imagination\, poetry\, conversations\, and/or arts-based wellness experi
 ences.  The activities are designed for grade 2 and up but all ages are we
 lcome. Strollers are welcome\, too.&#160\;  RSVP for the total number of p
 eople in your group\, including anyone in strollers\, so that we can plan 
 for space.&#160\;&#160\;  &#160\;Know Before You GoWalk-ins are welcome if
  there's space. To reserve a space\, RSVP below.Plan to arrive at least 5 
 minutes before your tour to check in and get ready.A small handbag may be 
 carried at your side. Larger bags and backpacks must be stored before tour
 ing. Free lockers are available.Where to find us\, where to park\, accessi
 bility\, and museum guidelinesWhen You ArriveCheck in with Guest Services 
 staff on the first floor.Photography is welcome\, without flash or selfie 
 stick.Please do not touch artwork.
