DESCRIPTION:Curious about Latin America and the Caribbean?  Interested in 
 the region's languages\, cultures\, histories\, and politics? Discover whe
 re your interests can take you!  Join the Center for Latin American and Ca
 ribbean Studies (CLACS) for a Virtual Open House and learn about our acade
 mic programs and opportunities!Thursday\, December 3\, 2026Location:Zoom -
  Register (https://iu.zoom.us/meeting/register/NKBxtjXJR-6N8jeUJcvYzg#/reg
 istration)Undergraduate Open House: 5:30–6:00 PM  Discover our Undergrad
 uate Minor and Certificate. Learn about language study\, study abroad\, sc
 holarships\, and potential funding opportunities.Graduate Open House:6:00-
 6:30 PM  Explore the new MA/MS of International and Regional Studies with 
 a Latin American &amp\; Caribbean track\, and the CLACS PhD Minor and Cert
 ificate\, interdisciplinary research opportunities\, and resources for gra
 duate students.All are welcome! Bring your questions\, meet our team\, and
  discover how Latin American and Caribbean Studies can develop your academ
 ic and professional goals.
LAST-MODIFIED:20261105T214218Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2470837-clacs-virtual-undergraduate-
 open-house
