DESCRIPTION:Please join us for an afternoon of discussion surrounding digi
 tal media\, online identity\, and mental health alongside our ongoing Happ
 iness 2.0 Project. An introduction will be led by Eskenazi Museum's Wilma 
 E. Kelley Director Mindy Besaw\, highlighting the importance of integratin
 g arts and sciences\, followed by a further presentation from the Happines
 s 2.0 Team. Anyone interested is welcome to attend.  The Happiness 2.0 Pro
 ject is a collaboration of the Eskenazi Museum of Art\, The Media School\,
  and IU Counseling and Psychological Services. More information about this
  initiative can be found on the Happiness 2.0 web page. (https://mediascho
 ol.indiana.edu/research/happiness-2.html)
