DESCRIPTION:Hog Wild Christmas Bazaar\nGet into the holiday spirit at the 
 Hog Wild Christmas Bazaar in Brown County\, Indiana!\nJoin us at the Brown
  County 4-H Fairgrounds for a festive day of holiday shopping\, delicious 
 food\, and seasonal fun. Browse 60+ vendors offering a wide variety of pro
 ducts\, unique finds\, and gifts for everyone on your Christmas list.\nTak
 e a break from shopping and grab a bite from the food and drink trucks on-
 site. Whether you’re searching for the perfect holiday gift or simply lo
 oking to enjoy a festive outing\, the Hog Wild Christmas Bazaar is a great
  way to kick off the holiday season while supporting local and regional ve
 ndors!\nEvent Details:\n\nDate: Saturday\, December 5\, 2026\nTime: 9:00 A
 M – 3:00 PM\nLocation: Brown County 4-H Fairgrounds\, Nashville\, Indian
 a\nFeaturing: 60+ vendors\, holiday shopping\, and food and drink trucks\n
 \nBring your friends and family for a day of Christmas shopping in Brown C
 ounty!\n
