DESCRIPTION:Sip\, shop\, and celebrate the season at the annual Uplands Wi
 nter Wine Market! Join Indiana Uplands Wine Country on December 5 at noon 
 at the historic Brown County Art Gallery to sample more than 100 Indiana w
 ines from nine wineries.\nDiscover new favorites and find wines for holida
 y gifting and gatherings. Tickets are $35 and include wine tasting from al
 l nine wineries\, a souvenir wine glass\, and a bottle tote.\nMake a day o
 f it in Brown County with a visit to the nearby Christkindl Market for eve
 n more holiday cheer!\nPurchase tickets at indianauplands.com ( https://ww
 w.indianauplands.com/ ).\n
