SUMMARY:Salvation Army Light Parade
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T233000
DTSTAMP:20241118T120317Z
UID:MEC-de29a915ea34068c06d487aaf243487b@browncounty.com__20261205
SEQUENCE:11
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/
 11/Light-Parade.jpg
CATEGORIES:Family Friendly,Happening,Holiday,Parade,Plan Your Visit,Specia
 l Events,Winter
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20241118
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a spectacular evening of twinkling lights and holi
 day magic at the annual Nashville Indiana Christmas Light Parade! Experien
 ce the enchanting sights and sounds of the holiday season as festive float
 s and vehicles adorned with dazzling Christmas lights glide through the he
 art of Nashville\, Indiana.\nFestive Lighted Parade\nThe Nashville\, India
 na\, Christmas Light Parade is a cherished community tradition that brings
  together families\, friends\, and visitors from near and far. Be amazed b
 y the creativity and holiday spirit as local businesses\, organizations\, 
 and individuals showcase their beautifully decorated floats and vehicles. 
 From whimsical displays to heartwarming scenes\, every entry is a glowing 
 testament to the season’s joy.\nSpreading Holiday Cheer\nAs the parade w
 inds through the picturesque streets of Nashville\, witness the town come 
 alive with Christmas cheer. Spectators will be treated to delightful perfo
 rmances\, live music\, and appearances by beloved holiday characters. The 
 spirit of the season will fill the air as families gather to share in the 
 warmth and magic of this festive event.\nSupporting The Salvation Army Toy
  Shoppe\nAt the heart of the Nashville\, Indiana\, Christmas Light Parade 
 is the spirit of giving. In the true holiday tradition\, we encourage all 
 participants and attendees to bring new\, unwrapped toys to donate to The 
 Salvation Army Toy Shoppe and spread joy to those less fortunate during th
 is particular time of year.  Let’s unite as a community to make a diffe
 rence and brighten the lives of children who deserve a magical Christmas.\
 nDon’t miss out on this joyous occasion that encapsulates the true spiri
 t of Christmas. Gather your loved ones and come to witness the brilliance 
 of the Nashville\, Indiana\, Christmas Light Parade! Together\, we can cre
 ate memories that will last a lifetime and bring joy to those in need.\nLe
 t’s light up Nashville and make this holiday season one to remember!\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260629
LOCATION:Nashville
ORGANIZER;CN="The Salvation Army":MAILTO:usc.ind.bco.corps@usc.salvationar
 my.org
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/salvation-army-light-parade/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
