 opographies-III-2026-graphite-rubbing-on-paper-WEB.rev.1788964548.jpg
X-LIVEWHALE-IMAGE-CAPTION:"Underlay (Topographies) III"\, 2026. Graphite r
 ubbing on paper.
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p class="p1">\n  The J. Irwin Miller Architecture Pro
 gram Lecture and Exhibition Series presents an exhibition by UK-born\, Chi
 cago-based artist Frances Lightbound.\n</p>
