BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events Livewhale 237": "https://events.iu.edu/lgbtq/event/2392369-rainbow-connection"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events_livewhale_237
SUMMARY:Rainbow Connection
DTSTART:20261207T163000Z
DTEND:20261207T173000Z
DTSTAMP:20260824T133911Z
UID:20261109T163000Z-2392369@events.iu.edu__20261207
CATEGORIES:Health and wellness
DESCRIPTION:Rainbow Connection offers a free\, confidential space for anyo
 ne under the LGBTQ+ umbrella to find community\, explore topics related to
  their identities\, learn about mental health topics\, or just have a week
 ly reset. This is a drop-in support group that does not require students t
 o sign up to participate.9/28 – "who I am" person drawing/talk about val
 ues and identity  10/5 – fall break intentions list/talk about self-care
  and goals  10/12 – mandalas/talk about mindfulness  10/19 - decorate a 
 "worth jar"/talk about gratitude and self-worth  10/26 – Winter Boos/ ta
 lk about self-care  11/2 – expressive art/talk about emotion regulation 
  11/9 – decorate tote bags  11/6 - stress balls/talk about stress manage
 ment  11/23 (Thanksgiving break) not meeting  11/30 – sensory jars/talk 
 about stress management and mindfulness  12/7 – coping toolboxAll Indian
 a University events\, groups\, activities\, educational\, cultural\, and h
 istorical observances welcome all members of the Indiana University commun
 ity.
GEO:39.168722;-86.525274
LAST-MODIFIED:20261027T153007Z
LOCATION:LGBTQ+ CULTURE CENTER
URL:https://events.iu.edu/lgbtq/event/2392369-rainbow-connection
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p><span data-teams="true">Rainbow Connection
  offers a free\, confidential space for anyone under the LGBTQ+ umbrella t
 o find community\, explore topics related to their identities\, learn abou
 t mental health topics\, or just have a weekly reset. This is a drop-in su
 pport group that does not require students to sign up to participate.</spa
 n></p><p class="x_MsoNormal"><span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody">9/28
  – "who I am" person drawing/talk about values and identity</span></p><p
  class="x_MsoNormal">  10/5 – fall break intentions list/talk about self
 -care and goals</p><p class="x_MsoNormal">  10/12 – mandalas/talk about 
 mindfulness</p><p class="x_MsoNormal">  10/19 - decorate a "worth jar"/tal
 k about gratitude and self-worth</p><p class="x_MsoNormal">  10/26 – Win
 ter Boos/ talk about self-care</p><p class="x_MsoNormal">  11/2 – expres
 sive art/talk about emotion regulation</p><p class="x_MsoNormal">  11/9 
 – decorate tote bags</p><p class="x_MsoNormal">  11/6 - stress balls/tal
 k about stress management</p><p class="x_MsoNormal">  11/23 (Thanksgiving 
 break) not meeting</p><p class="x_MsoNormal">  11/30 – sensory jars/talk
  about stress management and mindfulness</p><p class="x_MsoNormal">  12/7 
 – coping toolbox</p><p><span data-teams="true"><strong>All Indiana Unive
 rsity events\, groups\, activities\, educational\, cultural\, and historic
 al observances welcome all members of the Indiana University community.</s
 trong></span></p>
