DESCRIPTION:The quintessential basketball movie—and perhaps the quintes
 sential Indiana movie—returns to the big screen with a new 4K director'
 s cut. When a coach with a checkered past (a career-best Gene Hackman) an
 d a local drunk (the one and only Dennis Hopper) come together to train a
  high school basketball team\, this small-town Indiana squad skyrockets t
 o become a top contender for the state championship. [114 min\; sports\, 
 drama\; English]A Q&amp\;A with director David Anspaugh and writer Angelo
  Pizzo will follow the screening.
