DESCRIPTION:Before the dance performance  Tour the exhibition The Photogra
 phic Reflex: The Lee Marks and John C. DePrez Jr. Collection with the cura
 tor at 11:30 before the IU Contemporary Dance performance inspired by this
  exhibition\, at noon.&#160\;  Before the dance performance\, join Ben Lev
 y\, Glaubinger Curator of Works on Paper\, for a guided short tour at 11:3
 0 am to learn more about some of the photographs that inspired the dance p
 erformance. Details. (https://events.iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2395982-curato
 r-led-tour)  About the dance performance  IU Contemporary Dance students h
 ave selected artworks in the exhibition as inspiration for an interpretati
 ve dance performance at noon. They will perform original choreography\, in
 spired by the exhibition.Read more about this exhibition. (https://artmuse
 um.indiana.edu/exhibitions/2026-08-29-photographic-reflex-marks-deprez.htm
 l)
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924T224554Z
URL:https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2428155-contemporary-dance-performan
 ce
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<h3>  Before the dance performance</h3><p>  T
 our the exhibition The Photographic Reflex: The Lee Marks and John C. DePr
 ez Jr. Collection with the curator at 11:30 before the IU Contemporary Dan
 ce performance inspired by this exhibition\, at noon.&#160\;</p><p>  Befor
 e the dance performance\, join Ben Levy\, Glaubinger Curator of Works on P
 aper\, for a guided short tour at 11:30 am to learn more about some of the
  photographs that inspired the dance performance. <a href="https://events.
 iu.edu/artmuseum/event/2395982-curator-led-tour">Details.</a></p><h3>  Abo
 ut the dance performance</h3><p>  IU Contemporary Dance students have sele
 cted artworks in the exhibition as inspiration for an interpretative dance
  performance at noon. They will perform original choreography\, inspired b
 y the exhibition.</p><p><a href="https://artmuseum.indiana.edu/exhibitions
 /2026-08-29-photographic-reflex-marks-deprez.html">Read more about this ex
 hibition.</a></p>
