DESCRIPTION:Don’t touch that dial…this holiday season\, America’s fa
 vorite Christmas tradition is hittin’ the road! Broadcasting live from t
 he Grand Ol’ Radio Network on 1225 AM\, N-O-E-L Radio\, it’s Will Holi
 day’s Grand Ol’ Christmas Show! Step back in time with this raucous re
 tro radio show for a night of incredible music\, laughs\, and Christmas sp
 irit the whole family will love. Featuring all-time favorite festive Chris
 tmas classics like you’ve never heard them before and sketch comedy shen
 anigans that progressively and cleverly blur the lines between nostalgia a
 nd satire. Brought to you by The Grand Ol’ Production Company and a cast
  of the best artists and entertainers in Texas like Dalton Flake\, America
 na standout Blue Water Highway\, and the Grand Ol’ Radio Orchestra and G
 ospel Singers! From Texas to Michigan\, 18 cities\, and twenty-two dazzlin
 g performances\, November 20th through December 23rd. Find your show and g
 et tickets now at Gochristmasshow.com!\n
