 , a watercolor wreath or a snow globe scene. Drinks and treats from Percy
 ’s Perk provided.\nJoin us for our Friday Workshops! Workshops run from
  Friday\, September 25 to December 11\, 6PM to 8PM. Make sure to select yo
 ur workshop date and the 6:00 timeslot to be signed up. Your project price
  includes one beverage\; wine\, beer\, coffee\, espresso\, hot chocolate o
 r tea (other selections are available) Ages 15+\nSeats limited. You must b
 ook ahead. Please note that our workshops are non-refundable due to limite
