DESCRIPTION:<p><strong>Crafternoon - Sunday afternoons from 2-4PM.</strong
 >  </p><p>Crafting with humans!  Bring your supplies and craft with us.
   All ages welcome\, free event\, no purchase required.  All craft are w
 elcome\, just avoid anything with fumes or loud noises.  Coloring books a
 vailable if your craft is on a time out. Bring your own snacks &amp\; dri
 nks or order delivery if you&#39\;re hungry.  Indoor and outdoor seating 
