DESCRIPTION:Solstice Sunrise Run at 7:15 a.m.\n\n•    Sign up by December
  17 (click on "Register" button). \n•    FREE\, limited to 30 people.\n
 •    Meeting Location: Paynetown SRA\, Marina parking area (just past be
 ach)\n\nUsher in the winter solstice with a pre-dawn group run\, ending ju
 st in time to sip hot cocoa while we enjoy the sunrise together! The 3-mil
 e route is on park roads\; participants should be able to comfortably run 
 a 10:30 min/mile pace. Bring a headlamp or small hand-held flashlight.
GEO:39.092423;-86.423753
LOCATION:Monroe Lake\, Paynetown SRA\, Marina parking area
SUMMARY:Solstice Sunrise Run\, Paynetown SRA (Monroe Lake)
