  Light | $3 LI variations | $3 well shooters | $3 quesadillas | $3 appetiz
 ers | $6 flatbreads\n🌮 La Bodega – 3 tacos for $8.99 (Asada\, Chorizo
 \, Cabeza\, Rib Eye\, Tongue\, Arrachera)\n🥗 Le Petit Café – Lunch b
 uffet (salad bar\, pastries\, meat dish\, often quiche) – $7.95\n🍕 Mo
 ther Bear's (Until 4 PM\, Dine-In) – Large slice-of-the-day + soft drink
  – $5.50\n🍕 Mother Bear's (Lunch Specials) – Select pizza/salad/bre
 adstick combos – $7.50\n🍕 Mother Bear's (Dine-In) – Large specialty
