DESCRIPTION:Discardia Mending-Day meets at the Monroe County Public Librar
 y\, 303 East Kirkwood\, monthly on 2nd Saturdays from noon to 4pm. Bring y
 our sewing\, interest in sewing\, interest to learn\, willingness to teach
 \, or just bring pre-washed fabric items in need of mending or alteration!
  We fix and alter garments and other fabric items for free\, as a service 
 to the greater community\, for fun! Let's keep things useful and out of th
 e landfill together!
