DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270111T174500
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270111T190000
UID:tribe-10001130@namigreaterbloomingtonarea.org
DESCRIPTION:NAMI Family Support Group is a peer-led support group for any 
 adult with a loved one who has experienced symptoms of a mental health con
 dition. Gain insight from the challenges and successes of others facing si
 milar experiences.The NAMI Greater Bloomington Area (GBA) Family Support G
 roup meets on the second Monday of the month from 5:45pm – 7:00pm and me
 ets IN PERSON.Participants can choose to attend both in person and online 
 support groups\, but also can pick and choose which group to attend. Bo
LOCATION:First United Church\, 2420 East Third Street\, Bloomington
URL:https://namigreaterbloomingtonarea.org/event/family-support-group-in-p
 erson-2/2027-01-11/
X-SOURCE:NAMI Greater Bloomington
END:VEVENT
