 petencies.\nWhether you're new to leadership or already involved on campu
 s\, the Leadership Compass offers practical tools and meaningful conversa
 tions to elevate your leadership journey.\n📅 January 14th\, 2027⏰ 12:00 
 PM – 2:00 PM📍 IMU Frangipani Room\nAll Indiana University events\, group
 s\, activities\, and educational\, cultural\, and historical observances 
 welcome all IU students and other members of the Indiana University commu
 nity.\n\nHosted by: Indiana Memorial Union\, Student Involvement and Lead
 ership\n\nAdditional Information can be found at: https://beinvolved.indi
 ana.edu/event/12634528
