SUMMARY:Jourdain Fisher Returns to The Comedy Attic!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270205T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20270205T210000
UID:20270205-jourdain-fisher-returns-to-the-comedy-at-1900
DESCRIPTION:Jourdain Fisher is an American stand-up comedian\, writer\, ac
 tor\, and creator . He has made two appearances on The Tonight Show Starri
 ng Jimmy Fallon \, receiving a standing ovation both times\; his first app
 earance led to a staff writing position on the show. He has also appeared 
 on Comedy Central and CBS's After Midnigh t\, with additional writing cred
 its including Netflix\, BET\, and VICELAND. A Just For Laughs New Face and
  Stand Up NBC finalist\, Fisher released his debut hour-long comedy specia
 l\, Bits & Pieces \, in 2026. Beyond stand-up\, he is the creator of the v
 iral Gangster Chef and co-creator of Second Hand Exchang e\, with his orig
 inal comedy reaching millions of people across social media. Fisher tours 
 nationally and is based in New York City.
LOCATION:The Comedy Attic\, 123 S Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://www.comedyattic.com/shows/387453
X-SOURCE:The Comedy Attic, Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
